{#
Cursor rule document template.

Cursor uses .mdc format with YAML frontmatter.
Extends base.md.j2 but overrides frontmatter and require_approval section
since Cursor has limited ask capability (can_ask=False).

Cursor supports:
- Runtime interception (can_block=True)
- Limited ask capability - require_approval treated as deny
#}

{% extends "rule_docs/base.md.j2" %}

{% block frontmatter %}
---
globs: **/*
---
{% endblock %}

{% block require_approval_section scoped %}
> **Note**: This Agent does not support user confirmation prompts.
> Require-approval rules are treated as forbidden.

**Require Approval** → **Blocked** (no ask capability):
{% for rule in op_rules.require_approval %}
- `{{ rule.pattern }}`{% if rule.message %} — {{ rule.message }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% endblock %}
